    "key": "hong kong express",
    "name": "Hong Kong Express",
    "slots": {
      "origin": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "Hong Kong Express 是英國音樂人 David Russo 的名義，他受王家衛電影啟發，用這個名字做夢境般的 ambient。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dreampunk",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "Russo 在 2014 年創辦 Dream Catalogue 廠牌，早期專做 vaporwave 與「dream music」。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dreampunk",
            "from": "new",
            "src2": "https://de.ra.co/reviews/20492"
          },
          {
            "f": "英國音樂資料庫 MusicBrainz 登記 Hong Kong Express 為英國男性個人藝人，註記為 dreampunk／vaporwave 藝人。",
            "src": "https://musicbrainz.org/artist/12e61c13-aa7c-4cc0-b139-aa2e7301b417",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "sound": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "Resident Advisor 評論把 Dream Catalogue 稱作「dream music」的家：一個朦朧、偶爾焦慮的世界，現成取樣與原創樂器交融。",
            "src": "https://de.ra.co/reviews/20492",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "同一篇評論寫道，相較於放慢的搖擺取樣與 lo-fi，dream music 追求的是壯闊與史詩感。",
            "src": "https://de.ra.co/reviews/20492",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "legacy": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "維基的 dreampunk 條目稱這個曲風起源於 2814 的首作；2814 是 Russo（Hong Kong Express）與美國 vaporwave 製作人 Luke Laurila 在 2014 年 10 月組成的二人組。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dreampunk",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "Resident Advisor 稱 Russo 與 Dream Catalogue 在 vaporwave 式微之際帶頭開出新局，讓 vaporwave 藝人把音樂轉向更朦朧、更接近傳統 ambient 的方向。",
            "src": "https://de.ra.co/reviews/20492",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "era": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "2017 年 Russo 以 HKE 名義在 Olde English Spelling Bee 的 200 Series 子廠牌發行《Dragon Soul》，並壓製黑膠，這在夢境音樂圈是少見的事。",
            "src": "https://de.ra.co/reviews/20492",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
