    "key": "sync24",
    "name": "Sync24",
    "slots": {
      "origin": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "Sync24 是瑞典音樂人在 2007 年起用的個人名義，他同時是瑞典 downtempo／ambient 二人組 Carbon Based Lifeforms 的一半。",
            "src": "https://www.sonicimmersion.org/interview-with-sync24/",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "他說自己白天是程式設計師、晚上是作曲者；音樂背景幾乎是零，只上過學校的長笛與鋼琴課，早年迷的是電子器材，第一次接觸是 Commodore 64 上的簡單取樣播放器，製作全靠摸索。",
            "src": "https://www.sonicimmersion.org/interview-with-sync24/",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "他說 Carbon Based Lifeforms 要兩人都愛才算數，沒通過的曲子累積起來，Ultimae 廠牌想發行，所以有了 Sync24。",
            "src": "https://www.sonicimmersion.org/interview-with-sync24/",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "sound": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "他說首張個人專輯《Source》（2007，Ultimae）想做一張平靜到能讓人睡著、飄得很遠的專輯，也想試試一切由自己決定會怎樣。",
            "src": "https://www.sonicimmersion.org/interview-with-sync24/",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          },
          {
            "f": "Sonic Immersion 評《Source》：多半沒有 CBL 招牌的 acid 拍子，重心放在氛圍，更安靜、更催眠。",
            "src": "https://www.sonicimmersion.org/sync24-source/",
            "from": "new",
            "single": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "legacy": {
        "status": "none",
        "facts": []
      },
      "era": {
        "status": "none",
        "facts": []
      }
    },
    "milestones": [],
    "conflicts": [],
    "searches": 1,
    "status": "thin",
    "pubIssues": [],
    "failedFetches": [],
    "notes": "⚠ 真名三說不一（Segerstad／Ringström／Vadestrid），寫作層不寫本名。維基 CBL 條目列 Sync24 為成員個人計畫，與 Sonic Immersion 同為單源性質，皆低風險。Leftfield 廠牌 2012 年成立、首發《Ambient Archive》來自該訪談單源，不收。legacy 查無。"
